==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Heracross|8}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*'''Single Lunge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Bisharp|105}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

